{"id":"siyezen","qid":"Q1017683","category":"city","type":"oikonym","names":{"az":"Siyəzən","ru":"Сиазань","en":"Siyazan"},"coordinates":[49.10611,41.07833],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"quba-xacmaz","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q820940","az":"Siyəzən rayonu","en":"Siyazan District"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[{"form":"Кызыл-Бурун","lang":"ru","to":1954,"sources":["wp-ru"]}],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[{"lang":"ru","heading":"Название","text":"До 1954 года Сиазань назывался Кызыл-Бурун.\nЭтимология слова «Сиазань» доподлинно неизвестна. По мнению некоторых исследователей, «Сиазань» на иранских языках означает «чёрная земля», другие исследователи считают, что название означает «чёрная вода» и связывают его с добычей здесь нефти с давних времён.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru","anchor":"Название"}],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Siyəzən — Azərbaycan Respublikasının Siyəzən rayonunun Siyəzən şəhər inzibati ərazi dairəsində şəhər, Siyəzən rayonunun inzibati mərkəzi. 1954-cü ildə rayon tabeli şəhər statusu almışdır.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Сиаза́нь (азерб. Siyəzən, татск. Siyəzən) — город в Азербайджане, административный центр Сиазаньского района. Расположен на приморской низменности.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Siyazan (Azerbaijani: Siyəzən; Tat: Siya ji) is a city, municipality, and the capital of the Siyazan District of Azerbaijan. It has a population of 24,900. The city's name is said to be derived from Persian or from the Tat language meaning \"White Women,\" a reference to the original population Tats. Another explanation links the name with the Persian word siyah, meaning \"black\".","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Siazan.JPG/960px-Siazan.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Siazan.JPG/960px-Siazan.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":532,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Siazan.JPG","title":"Siazan.JPG","artist":"22 july at Russian Wikipedia","credit":"Transferred from ru.wikipedia to Commons.","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q1017683: Siyazan","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1017683","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Siyəzən","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Siy%C9%99z%C9%99n&oldid=8899268","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siy%C9%99z%C9%99n","revid":8899268,"revDate":"2026-05-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Сиазань","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%A1%D0%B8%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%8C&oldid=156105089","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B8%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%8C","revid":156105089,"revDate":"2026-11-10","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Siyazan","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Siyazan&oldid=1383775936","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siyazan","revid":1383775936,"revDate":"2026-11-04","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Siazan.JPG","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Siazan.JPG","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"sourced"}